Shell allowance in the family p = -(u-T')(u-c)^2
eta* = (T'-T) * max(|T-c|,|T'-c|)^2   is the smallest admissible allowance

  T=12  T'=27/2 c=1    M=25/2  eta* = 1875/8       = 234.375000   p(0) = 13.5000
  T=12  T'=27/2 c=3    M=21/2  eta* = 1323/8       = 165.375000   p(0) = 121.5000
