  T=12  T'=27/2 c=8    M=11/2  eta* = 363/8        = 45.375000   p(0) = 864.0000
  T=12  T'=27/2 c=12   M=3/2  eta* = 27/8         = 3.375000   p(0) = 1944.0000

CONSEQUENCE (proved inside the family)
  eta* > 0 for every T < T', and the objective charges n*eta* with n >= 12,
  so every shell member of this family is STRICTLY WORSE than the corresponding
  eta = 0 member.  No search is needed to see this: the family's shape forces it.

  For comparison, the best eta = 0 member of the family (T' = T) is the cubic
  certificate of sos_family.py, Delta <= 5.99152482.

